You can ﬁlter cold indexes based on a preﬁx-based index pattern and time range oﬀsets.
The following request lists indexes that match the preﬁx pattern of event-*:
GET _cold/indices/_search
{
"filters":{
"index_pattern": "event-*"
}
}
Sample response
{
"pagination_id" : "je7MtGbClwBF/2Zp9Utk/h3yCo8nvbEXAMPLEKEY",
