The following request returns indexes with start_time and end_time metadata ﬁelds between
2019-03-01 and 2020-03-01:
GET _cold/indices/_search
{
"filters": {
"time_range": {
"start_time": "2019-03-01",
"end_time": "2020-03-01"
}
}
}
Sample response
